# Mintlify automatically ignores these files and directories:
# .git, .github, .claude, .agents, .idea, node_modules,
# README.md, LICENSE.md, CHANGELOG.md, CONTRIBUTING.md

# Agent skills, not site content. Their relative links resolve on disk, not on the
# published site, so leaving them in produces false broken-link reports.
.cursor/

# Draft content
drafts/
*.draft.mdx
